  "description": "Pre-monsoon baseline along the Trishuli–Bhote Koshi corridor, acquired three months before the flood. A single PlanetScope strip running north from Trishuli Bazaar (Bidur) through Betrawati, Dhunche and Syabrubesi to the Rasuwagadhi border crossing and on into Gyirong County, Tibet. Cloud cover ranges 5–52%; the southernmost scene is near-clear at 5%. 5 scenes; each Item carries the available visual, analytic_sr, udm2 assets.",
